,"_score_pool_share":45.2,"_gate_rev_durability":null,"_gp_rev_durability":null,"_score_rev_durability":0.0,"_gate_fcf_durability":null,"_gp_fcf_durability":null,"_score_fcf_durability":0.0,"_gate_margins":null,"_gp_margins":null,"_score_margins":0.0,"_gate_fund_growth":null,"_gp_fund_growth":null,"_score_fund_growth":0.0,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.023559547488069883,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":true,"_score_shrhldr_yield":37.3,"_gate_share_shrink":0.06386282583537928,"_gp_share_shrink":false,"_score_share_shrink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":null,"_gp_sbc_dilution":null,"_score_sbc_dilution":0.0,"_gate_insider_own":0.00116,"_gp_insider_own":false,"_score_insider_own":0.8,"_gate_insider_buying":null,"_gp_insider_buying":null,"_score_insider_buying":null,"pf":[],"description_full":"National Grid plc engages in the transmission and distribution of electricity and gas. It operates through UK Electricity Transmission, UK Electricity Distribution, New England, New York, National Grid Ventures, and Other segments. The UK Electricity Transmission segment provides electricity transmission networks in England and Wales. The UK Electricity Distribution segment offers electricity distribution services in east and west Midlands, Southwest of England, and South Wales. The New England segment provides electricity and gas supply and distribution, and high-voltage electricity transmission services in New England. The New York segment offers electricity and gas distribution, and electricity transmission services in New York. The National Grid Ventures segment provides transmission services through electricity interconnectors and LNG importation at the Isle of Grain. The Other segment engages in the leasing and sale of commercial property, as well as insurance activities in the United Kingdom. The company was founded in 1990 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.","ceo_bio":"Ms. Zoe Alexandra Yujnovich | CEO & Director | Age 50 | Compensation: $3.8M (FY2026)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 33K people. Revenue per employee of $719K ranks in the bottom quartile among Utilities peers. CEO compensation is 5\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity).","financial_summary":["National Grid Transco, PLC Nati is a large-cap utilities business with a $83.6B market cap on $23.8B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -2% over the past three years, and a shrinking top line is the hardest headwind any business can overcome.","Returns on capital run at 6% against a 6% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","On the balance sheet, debt is heavy at 7.2\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and leverage like that is what turns a bad year into a permanent loss, and thin 2.7\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield of 2.4% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 60% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.595580936949578},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.5) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Revenue growth lags most Utilities peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Carries more leverage than most Utilities peers \u2014 a smaller cushion for the inevitable bad year","sev":"amber","cat":"balance_sheet"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Regulatory rate-case risk and rising cost of capital \u2014 the allowed return is set by commissions, and the business lives or dies by that negotiation.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Grid modernisation capex burden \u2014 aging infrastructure requires massive reinvestment that regulators may not fully allow into rate base, compressing earned returns.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Wildfire and climate liability \u2014 extreme weather events create catastrophic, uninsurable losses that can push even investment-grade utilities toward restructuring.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["20 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Utilities sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter","Utilities tends to hold up well as investors rotate into defensive names"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"National Grid (NGG) Q2 2027 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/national-grid-ngg-q2-2027-172958490.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793899798.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"European stocks tumble on AI regulation fears","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/world-indices/articles/european-stocks-tumble-ai-regulation-194835006.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793994515.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.772,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":["regulatory"]},{"title":"Route 28 reopens after overnight gas main work in West Yarmouth","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/route-28-reopens-overnight-gas-182834000.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793990657.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Willdan Group (WLDN) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com